<h1>HTTP observation <span style="color:red;">error</span></h1>

<p>
  This could be an outage with your service provider, or maybe something wrong with
  HTTPizza. We recommend that you review your observer configuration below, and manually
  verify your site.
</p>

<.links http_observation={@http_observation} />

<p>
  You are receiving this notification because the observer is configured to notify this
  address on unexpected errors.
</p>
